<centred-content-block class="breakout lgcc-titles">
  <h1 class="ui-h2">Explore the world of curling with us</h1>
  <p>
    Letham Grange Curling Club is more than just a club; it is a community
    passionate about curling. We offer various opportunities for all skill
    levels, from beginners to experienced players. Join us and discover the joy
    of the 'roaring game'.
  </p>
</centred-content-block>

